# Full BI Workspace Implementation Plan

## Background

The user wants to implement a full **Power BI Desktop-level** workspace from [powerbi.txt](file:///c:/Users/Lenovo/Downloads/25_osa/powerbi.txt). This covers 11 major feature areas. The existing codebase already has partial implementations of some features.

