## Phase 2 — Ribbon Completeness (Home, Insert, Modeling, View, External Tools)

### Goal: All ribbon tabs must render meaningful toolbars

#### [MODIFY] [BIRibbon.jsx](file:///c:/Users/Lenovo/Downloads/25_osa/one-stop-analytics-saa-s-frontend/frontend/src/components/BIRibbon.jsx)
- **Home Tab** — Already mostly done. Add: Format Painter, Manage Parameters, Data Source Settings, Recent Sources
- **Insert Tab** — Add toolbar: all visual types, Button types (Back, Drill-through, Navigation), Bookmark Navigator, Shapes, Images, AI Visuals
- **Modeling Tab** — Add toolbar: New Measure, New Calculated Column, New Table, Quick Measures, Manage Relationships, Cardinality, RLS Settings
- **View Tab** — Add toolbar: Theme switcher, Page View (Fit/Actual), Gridlines toggle, Snap to grid, Selection pane toggle, Bookmarks pane, Performance analyzer, Sync slicers
- **External Tools Tab** — Add toolbar: DAX Analyzer (link/launch modal), Model Editor, Performance tools

