## Phase 4 — Visualization Library & Calculation Engine

### Goal: Full chart library + DAX-like formula editor

#### [MODIFY] [DynamicChart.jsx](file:///c:/Users/Lenovo/Downloads/25_osa/one-stop-analytics-saa-s-frontend/frontend/src/components/DynamicChart.jsx)
- Ensure all types work with real data: Bar, Column, Line, Area, Combo, Pie, Donut, Treemap, Waterfall, Funnel, Scatter
- Add: **Card**, **Multi-row Card**, **KPI**, **Gauge**, **Table**, **Matrix** renderers
- Map visuals support: placeholder map with region highlighting
- AI Visuals section: Key Influencers (already exists), Decomposition tree (tree-view component), Q&A (text input → chart output), Smart Narrative (text summary from stats)
- Each visual must support aggregation: Sum, Avg, Count, Distinct Count, Min, Max (pass via graphDefinition)

#### [NEW] `BICalculationEditor.jsx` + `BICalculationEditor.css`
- Modal/panel opened from Modeling tab
- DAX-like formula bar: `SUMX = SUM([SalesAmount])`, `YTD = TOTALYTD([Sales], [Date])`
- Functions: SUM, AVERAGE, COUNT, DISTINCTCOUNT, MAX, MIN, CALCULATE, FILTER, ALL, RELATED
- Time intelligence: TOTALYTD, TOTALMTD, SAMEPERIODLASTYEAR
- Formula validation with error highlighting
- Create Measure / Calculated Column / Calculated Table

